{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/uk-to-develop-new-deep-strike-ballistic-missile-for-ukraine","content_id":"54d39506-996e-4e8d-aa67-b21752141cb9","description":"The UK will develop new tactical ballistic missiles that boost Ukraine’s firepower to defend itself from Putin’s war machine.   ","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\">\n<div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <ul>\n    <li>New ballistic missile could carry a 200kg warhead over a range of more than 500 kilometres.</li>\n    <li>Missile will provide Ukraine a long range-punch to counter Russian aggression</li>\n    <li>Project aims to boost UK defence industry, supporting innovation and growth while stepping up support for Ukraine into 2026.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<p>The UK will develop new tactical ballistic missiles that boost Ukraine’s firepower to defend itself from Putin’s war machine.</p>\n\n<p>Under Project Nightfall, the UK has launched a competition to rapidly develop ground-launched ballistic missiles with a range of more than 500 kilometres and designed to operate in high-threat battlefields with heavy electromagnetic interference.</p>\n\n<p>Nightfall missiles will be capable of being launched from a range of vehicles, firing multiple missiles in quick succession and withdrawing within minutes – allowing Ukrainian forces to hit key military targets before Russian forces can respond.</p>\n\n<p>With a 200kg conventional high explosive warhead, high precision production rate of 10 systems per month and a maximum price of £800,000 per missile, NIGHTFALL is intended to provide Ukraine with a powerful, cost-effective long-range strike option, with minimal foreign export controls.</p>\n\n<p>The Nightfall project builds on the UK’s ironclad commitment to Ukraine, particularly to its long range capabilities, through the gifting of thousands of deep strike one-way attack drones.</p>\n\n<p>Defence Secretary John Healey MP said:</p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>The attacks overnight on Thursday just go to show how Putin thinks he can act with impunity, targeting civilian areas with advanced weaponry.</p>\n\n  <p>Instead of seriously negotiating a peace, he’s seriously escalating his illegal war.</p>\n\n  <p>We were close enough to hear the air raid sirens around Lviv on our journey to Kyiv, it was a serious moment and a stark reminder of the barrage of drones and missiles hitting Ukrainians in sub-zero conditions.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"last-child\">We won’t stand for this, which is why we are determined to put leading edge weapons into the hands of Ukrainians as they fight back.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<p>Minister for Defence Readiness and Industry, Luke Pollard MP said:</p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>A secure Europe needs a strong Ukraine. These new long-range British missiles will keep Ukraine in the fight and give Putin another thing to worry about.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"last-child\">In 2026, we will continue to stand shoulder to shoulder with Ukraine. Providing equipment to keep them in the fight today, whilst working to secure the peace tomorrow.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<p>The project aims for three industry teams to each be awarded a £9 million development contract to design, develop and deliver their first three missiles within 12 months for test firings.</p>\n\n<p>Nightfall is a project focused on rapid prototyping, spiral development, resilience to electronic warfare, and the ability to scale manufacturing quickly, particularly in the UK.</p>\n\n<p>Whilst aimed at supporting Ukraine, Nightfall will also inform future UK Armed Forces’ long range strike projects.</p>\n\n<p>The detailed Nightfall requirements were shared with Industry Partners on the 19 December 2025 that had signed the required confidentiality and security arrangements. The deadline to receive Nightfall development proposals is the 9th February 2026, with development contract(s) aimed to be awarded in March 2026.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-11T00:00:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["d994e55c-48c9-4795-b872-58d8ec98af12"],"images":[{"caption":"","content_type":"image/jpeg","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6963f579183e25d7051e0d33/s216_DDC-OFFICIAL-20260109-001-0332.jpg","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6963f57999fbdc498faeccad/s300_DDC-OFFICIAL-20260109-001-0332.jpg","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6963f5795534c732221e0d35/s465_DDC-OFFICIAL-20260109-001-0332.jpg","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6963f579e8b93f59c3aeccad/s630_DDC-OFFICIAL-20260109-001-0332.jpg","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6963f57999fbdc498faeccae/s712_DDC-OFFICIAL-20260109-001-0332.jpg","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6963f579183e25d7051e0d34/s960_DDC-OFFICIAL-20260109-001-0332.jpg"},"type":"lead"}],"political":true},"document_type":"press_release","first_published_at":"2026-01-11T00:00:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/uk-to-develop-new-deep-strike-ballistic-missile-for-ukraine","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/uk-to-develop-new-deep-strike-ballistic-missile-for-ukraine","base_path":"/government/news/uk-to-develop-new-deep-strike-ballistic-missile-for-ukraine","content_id":"54d39506-996e-4e8d-aa67-b21752141cb9","document_type":"press_release","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-01-11T00:00:00Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"UK to develop new deep strike ballistic missile for Ukraine","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/uk-to-develop-new-deep-strike-ballistic-missile-for-ukraine","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/uk-to-develop-new-deep-strike-ballistic-missile-for-ukraine.ru","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/uk-to-develop-new-deep-strike-ballistic-missile-for-ukraine.ru","base_path":"/government/news/uk-to-develop-new-deep-strike-ballistic-missile-for-ukraine.ru","content_id":"54d39506-996e-4e8d-aa67-b21752141cb9","document_type":"press_release","links":{},"locale":"ru","public_updated_at":"2026-01-11T00:00:00Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"Великобритания разработает для Украины новую баллистическую ракету для нанесения глубинных ударов ","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/uk-to-develop-new-deep-strike-ballistic-missile-for-ukraine.ru","withdrawn":false}],"emphasised_organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D17","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","content_id":"d994e55c-48c9-4795-b872-58d8ec98af12","details":{"acronym":"MOD","brand":"ministry-of-defence","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46d3bf7f618eda94d2/s960_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d468fa8f5346732690e/s300_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"mod","formatted_title":"Ministry<br/>of Defence"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Ministry of Defence","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","withdrawn":false}],"government":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","base_path":"/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","content_id":"9dbff654-cdeb-4ebe-9a12-cd4cc20a033e","details":{"current":false,"ended_on":"2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00","started_on":"2024-07-05T00:00:00+00:00"},"document_type":"government","links":{},"locale":"en","title":"2024 to 2026 Starmer Labour government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/2024-starmer-labour-government"}],"organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D17","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","content_id":"d994e55c-48c9-4795-b872-58d8ec98af12","details":{"acronym":"MOD","brand":"ministry-of-defence","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46d3bf7f618eda94d2/s960_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d468fa8f5346732690e/s300_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"mod","formatted_title":"Ministry<br/>of Defence"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Ministry of Defence","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","withdrawn":false}],"people":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/luke-pollard","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/luke-pollard","base_path":"/government/people/luke-pollard","content_id":"0e11b976-f017-4c29-b0f2-94468466af99","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-22T15:26:00Z","schema_name":"person","title":"Luke Pollard MP","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/luke-pollard","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/john-healey","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/john-healey","base_path":"/government/people/john-healey","content_id":"6e000fab-7c45-479a-8362-53a971f31f28","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-20T17:50:11Z","schema_name":"person","title":"The Rt Hon John Healey MP","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/john-healey","withdrawn":false}],"primary_publishing_organisation":[{"analytics_identifier":"D17","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","content_id":"d994e55c-48c9-4795-b872-58d8ec98af12","details":{"acronym":"MOD","brand":"ministry-of-defence","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46d3bf7f618eda94d2/s960_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d468fa8f5346732690e/s300_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"mod","formatted_title":"Ministry<br/>of Defence"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Ministry of Defence","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","withdrawn":false}],"roles":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--207","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--207","base_path":"/government/ministers/minister-of-state--207","content_id":"47758af5-c983-42a1-bce4-e27428d164fb","details":{"body":"<ul>\n  <li>Implementation of relevant SDR Vision and Defence Investment Plan</li>\n  <li>Oversight of the National Armaments Director Group</li>\n  <li>Departmental communications strategy and reform</li>\n  <li>Armed forces readiness and stockpiles</li>\n  <li>Defence procurement, including reform and UK Defence Innovation</li>\n  <li>Submarine delivery</li>\n  <li>Defence Industrial Strategy implementation and Growth</li>\n  <li>Defence Exports Campaigns and Office</li>\n  <li>Defence Readiness Bill</li>\n  <li>Ukraine support - military aid and industrial partnerships, including HIRST and KINDRED</li>\n  <li>Defence industry relationships and the Defence Industrial Joint Council</li>\n  <li>UK Defence Innovation and artificial intelligence</li>\n  <li>Climate change and sustainability</li>\n  <li>Science and technology</li>\n  <li>Defence Afghanistan Relocation and Assistance Programme (ARAP) including eligibility applications and asylum</li>\n  <li>Oversight of Parliamentary engagement and AFPS</li>\n  <li>Defence Infrastructure Organisation and defence estates</li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":100,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-25T09:12:36Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Minister of State (Minister for Defence Readiness and Industry)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/minister-of-state--207","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-defence","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-defence","base_path":"/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-defence","content_id":"845e5e80-c0f1-11e4-8223-005056011aef","details":{"body":"<p>The Secretary of State for Defence has overall responsibility for the business of the department.</p>\n\n<p>Responsibilities include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Strategic policy and operational oversight including as a member of the National Security Council</li>\n  <li>Nuclear deterrent (CASD) and operations policy and enterprise</li>\n  <li>Strategic overview of the Strategic Defence Review Implementation and Defence Investment Plan</li>\n  <li>Defence budget</li>\n  <li>Euro-Atlantic strategy and planning</li>\n  <li>Defence strategy, planning, programme, and resource allocation</li>\n  <li>Relationships with strategic international partners: US, France, Germany, Australia, Ukraine</li>\n  <li>One Defence Reform Programme</li>\n  <li>Oversight of Veterans</li>\n  <li>Service Personnel deaths on duty and letters of condolence</li>\n  <li>Strategic multilateral programmes – AUKUS and GCAP</li>\n  <li>Regulatory functions</li>\n  <li>Support on Afghan Inquiry</li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":11,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-14T12:39:26Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Secretary of State for Defence","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-defence","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/defence/military-equipment-logistics-technology","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/defence/military-equipment-logistics-technology","base_path":"/defence/military-equipment-logistics-technology","content_id":"ac5d432a-11a9-40e1-bb83-0de26106b9d6","details":{"internal_name":"Military equipment, logistics and technology [T] (level 2, defence theme)","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/defence-and-armed-forces","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/defence-and-armed-forces","base_path":"/defence-and-armed-forces","content_id":"e491505c-77ae-45b2-84be-8c94b94f6a2b","description":"","details":{"internal_name":"Defence and armed forces","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":true},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"root_taxon":[{"api_path":"/api/content/","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/","base_path":"/","content_id":"f3bbdec2-0e62-4520-a7fd-6ffd5d36e03a","document_type":"homepage","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-02-18T13:00:23Z","schema_name":"homepage","title":"GOV.UK homepage","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/","withdrawn":false}]},"locale":"en","phase":"live","public_updated_at":"2018-09-16T20:34:16Z","schema_name":"taxon","title":"Defence and armed forces","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/defence-and-armed-forces","withdrawn":false}]},"locale":"en","phase":"live","public_updated_at":"2018-09-05T16:16:53Z","schema_name":"taxon","title":"Military equipment, logistics and technology","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/defence/military-equipment-logistics-technology","withdrawn":false}],"topical_events":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/topical-events/russian-invasion-of-ukraine-uk-government-response","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/topical-events/russian-invasion-of-ukraine-uk-government-response","base_path":"/government/topical-events/russian-invasion-of-ukraine-uk-government-response","content_id":"bfa79635-ffda-4b5d-8266-a9cd3a03649c","document_type":"topical_event","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-02-26T14:13:57Z","schema_name":"topical_event","title":"Russian invasion of Ukraine: UK government response","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/topical-events/russian-invasion-of-ukraine-uk-government-response","withdrawn":false}],"world_locations":[{"analytics_identifier":"WL154","content_id":"5e9f274b-7706-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","document_type":"world_location","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2022-02-23T11:37:06Z","schema_name":"world_location","title":"Ukraine","withdrawn":false}]},"locale":"en","phase":"live","public_updated_at":"2026-01-11T00:00:00+00:00","publishing_app":"whitehall","publishing_request_id":"21-1773658115.790-10.13.22.163-2742","publishing_scheduled_at":null,"rendering_app":"frontend","scheduled_publishing_delay_seconds":null,"schema_name":"news_article","title":"UK to develop new deep strike ballistic missile for Ukraine","updated_at":"2026-08-25T10:12:38+01:00","withdrawn_notice":{}}